## Insight 4

The U.S. remains the largest content consumer on Netflix, and we should continue to capitalize on our market share in this region. Meanwhile, Asian and European countries present significant opportunities for expanding our subscriber base. As semi-developed countries experience an internet boom, we can expect growth in various parts of the world. Although we face competition from platforms like HBO, Amazon Prime, and Hulu, adopting a first-mover strategy in these emerging markets will allow us to tap into a vast, untapped audience.

**Suggestion:** Netflix should actively participate in internet expansion campaigns globally. This involvement will not only help create new markets but also foster a sentimental connection with the growth stories of various nations.

Now, we will explore the durations of the content available on Netflix.

