## Insight 11

The chart above shows that nearly 70% of movies are suitable for audiences of all age groups. This aligns with the fact that the success of most films is largely determined by box office collections, which aim to reach the broadest audience possible.  
In contrast, TV shows contribute over 43% of content classified as 'Adult,' along with more than 27% in the PG category. This highlights the maturity of the TV show and web series audience, reflecting the distinct goals of this longer format of content.

In conclusion, this report highlights the importance of understanding content ratings, viewer preferences, and genre trends on our platform. By analyzing these factors, we can make informed decisions that enhance audience engagement and optimize our content offerings. As we continue to adapt to shifting viewer demands and cultural influences, our focus on diverse and high-quality programming will be key to driving growth and satisfaction among our user base.
